>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SUB-MS.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-A PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
01 WS-B PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
01 WS-C PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
01 WS-D PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LOGIC.
    DISPLAY "SUB MULTISOURCE DEMO STARTED".
    MOVE 10 TO WS-A.
    MOVE 5 TO WS-B.
    MOVE 100 TO WS-C.
    DISPLAY "INITIAL A=" WS-A " B=" WS-B " C=" WS-C.
    SUBTRACT WS-A WS-B FROM WS-C GIVING WS-D.
    DISPLAY "SUB A B FROM C GIVING D: D=" WS-D " C=" WS-C.
    MOVE 10 TO WS-A.
    MOVE 5 TO WS-B.
    MOVE 100 TO WS-C.
    SUBTRACT WS-A WS-B FROM WS-C.
    DISPLAY "SUB A B FROM C INPLACE: C=" WS-C.
    DISPLAY "SUB MULTISOURCE DEMO COMPLETED".
    STOP RUN.
